<navigation-bar title="星董卓镇边" back="{{true}}" color="black" background="#FFF"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="page-shell" scroll-y type="list">
  <view class="header-card">
    <view class="header-top">
      <view>
        <text class="card-title">星董卓镇边</text>
        <text class="card-desc">锁定技：当有牌不因使用置入弃牌堆时，你记录这些牌的花色；记录四种花色且体力上限小于8时，清除记录并加1点体力上限。</text>
      </view>
      <button class="clear-btn {{clearBtnDisabled ? 'clear-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bind:tap="handleClear">清空</button>
    </view>
    <view class="status-chips">
      <text class="chip-primary">已记录 {{recordedCount}} / {{suits.length}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{isComplete}}" class="chip-success">集齐！体力上限+1</text>
      <text wx:elif="{{recordedCount === 0}}" class="chip">未记录花色</text>
      <text wx:else class="chip">还差 {{suits.length - recordedCount}} 种</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="remind-card">
    <view class="remind-head">
      <text class="remind-tag">死亡提醒</text>
      <text class="remind-title">有人死亡后可印牌（暴袭）</text>
    </view>
    <view class="remind-body">
      <text class="remind-desc">角色死亡时，其手牌、装备区、判定区的牌会一次性全部进入弃牌堆，可触发【暴袭】（每轮各限一次）：</text>
      <view class="remind-list">
        <view class="remind-item">
          <text class="remind-key">≥2张基本牌</text>
          <text class="remind-val">减1点体力上限，将一张手牌当【决斗】使用</text>
        </view>
        <view class="remind-item">
          <text class="remind-key">≥2张非基本牌</text>
          <text class="remind-val">减1点体力上限，将一张手牌当不计入次数且无次数限制的【杀】使用</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text class="remind-note">死亡入堆的牌同样计入镇边花色，别忘了同步点选记录。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <text class="section-title">花色记录</text>
    <text class="section-desc">点击切换花色的记录状态。集齐四种后自动清空。</text>
    <view class="suit-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{suits}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="suit-btn {{recorded[item.key] ? 'suit-btn--active' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bind:tap="handleToggleSuit"
      >
        <text class="suit-symbol" style="color: {{item.color}};">{{item.symbol}}</text>
        <text class="suit-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <view wx:if="{{recorded[item.key]}}" class="suit-check">
          <text class="suit-check-icon">✓</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-card">
    <text wx:if="{{isComplete}}" class="summary-text summary-text--complete">四种花色已集齐！镇边触发，体力上限+1，记录已重置。</text>
    <text wx:elif="{{recordedCount === 0}}" class="summary-text">当前未记录任何花色。当未使用的牌进入弃牌堆时，点击对应花色进行记录。</text>
    <text wx:else class="summary-text">已记录花色：{{recordedNames}}</text>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
